The only four pieces of client JS that earn their place (audit §9), translated
off Velo per docs/02-project-structure.md §3 Rule 3:
  - sticky-header scroll state (IntersectionObserver on a hero sentinel)
  - Calendly inline embed, lazy-mounted, explicit height
  - scroll reveal (one IntersectionObserver, CSS does the rest)
  - mobile sticky CTA
The FAQ accordion is native <details>/<summary> and needs no JS at all.
